<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>درع تيسمسيلت السيبراني | Sekine-dz</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@400;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;background:#0a101a;color:#e0e0e0;line-height:1.8}
:root{--green:#00ff88;--dark:#0a101a;--card:#111a26;--gray:#8a9bb0}
header{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0a101a 0%,#0f2235 100%);padding:20px 5%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:2px solid var(--green)}
.logo{font-weight:900;font-size:26px;color:var(--green)}
nav a{color:var(--gray);text-decoration:none;margin:0 12px;font-weight:700}
.hero{text-align:center;padding:80px 5% 50px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at center, #123 0%, #0a101a 70%)}
.hero h1{font-size:42px;font-weight:900;color:white}
.hero h1 b{color:var(--green)}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--green);color:#000;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:30px;font-weight:900;text-decoration:none;margin:5px}
